        "line": 26,
        "text": "def speedCutoff (δ v : ℝ) : ℝ := 1 - Real.smoothTransition ((v - lowSpeed δ) / (δ / 8)); speedCutoff_mem_Icc ∈ [0,1], speedCutoff_one for v ≤ 2 + δ/8, speedCutoff_zero for 2 + δ/4 ≤ v"
